OL,3,AMiliband says UK had to 'call out'
OL,4,AIsraeli West Bank settlements
OL,5,
OL,6,FForeign Secretary Ed Miliband says the
OL,7,FUK had to "call out" Israeli settlement
OL,8,Factivity in the West Bank before it was
OL,9,F"too late" to save the two-state
OL,10,Fsolution
OL,12,FHe tells the BBC the prospect of a
OL,13,FPalestinian state alongside Israel is
OL,14,F"being destroyed by the facts on the
OL,15,Fground"
OL,17,FHe also rejects the chief rabbi's claim
OL,18,Fthat British sanctions could lead to
OL,19,Fincreased antisemitism for Jewish
OL,20,Fpeople in the UK
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/39
