OL,3,ATycoon to pay ex-wife $1.87bn in record
OL,4,ASouth Korea divorce settlement
OL,5,
OL,6,FA South Korean court has ordered gaming
OL,7,Ftycoon Kwon Hyuk-bin to pay his ex-wife
OL,8,F2.55tr won ($1.87bn; #1.38bn) in
OL,9,Fassets, marking the largest divorce
OL,10,Fsettlement in the country's history.
OL,12,FKwon, who founded South Korea's
OL,13,Fthird-largest video game company
OL,14,FSmilegate, is one of the country's
OL,15,Frichest men. Bloomberg puts his net
OL,16,Fworth at $3bn.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
